summaryCard = TextContent("This PR fixes a critical bug in the utility `remove_control_characters` used across Odoo for XML sanitization by properly filtering non-XML Unicode characters at the Unicode code point level instead of mistakenly applying a bytes regex. The fix enhances compatibility with lxml and eliminates errors due to illegal XML characters. The change includes backward-compatible input/output handling for bytes/str and adds relevant regression tests covering allowed controls and type scenarios. The patch is focused, tested, and well explained.", "default")
